    "text": "<p>The number of stereo isomers possible for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>ox</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>Br</mi></mfenced><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> is&nbsp;__________.</p><p>[<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ox</mi><mo>=</mo></math> oxalate]</p>"
  },
